               MOVE PS-EMPLOYEE-DEPT TO EMPLOYEE-DEPT
               MOVE PS-EMPLOYEE-LOCATION TO EMPLOYEE-LOCATION
               MOVE PS-EMPLOYEE-SALARY TO EMPLOYEE-SALARY
